&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You open the drawer, and pull out the gun. You absentmindedly turn it over in your hands for a moment, wondering where you&#039;ll go from here. Site-17? 64? Surely &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/umbra&quot;&gt;you&lt;/a&gt; can&#039;t be all that&#039;s &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/the-sun-ever-sets-on-the-british-empire&quot;&gt;left&lt;/a&gt;? The computer dings. There&#039;s been an update to the file?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
