&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/if-i-tried-to-run-would-you-give-me-a-shot&quot;&gt;If I Tried to Run, Would You Give Me a Shot?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/tying-the-gordian-knot&quot;&gt;Tying the Gordian Knot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/a-sensible-use-of-human-life&quot;&gt;A Sensible Use of Human Life&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Quick exploration and description of Madison Craggs in the OCT. Weird character choices all around, but I felt pretty good about the first two tales. &lt;em&gt;Sensible Use&lt;/em&gt; is a rushed entry to make sure I had something for judging - I think the premise has merit but it&#039;s not great in its current form.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lazar-lyusternik&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2326669&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606853686&quot; alt=&quot;Lazar Lyusternik&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2326669)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lazar-lyusternik&quot;  &gt;Lazar Lyusternik&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
