&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Greetings, fellow humans!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If by any chance you clicked the link to this page, it probably means you read one of my articles. How about you learn who I am then? I&#039;m &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688&quot; alt=&quot;Ralliston&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston&quot;  &gt;Ralliston&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-440344-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, an amateur writer on the SCP Wiki.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a very proud owner of two of the bestest girls, Fiffy and Franny&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-440344-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; (of Fifka and Franka, as dog names don&#039;t translate well), a giant science-nerd, and an unhealthy fan of Queen and David Bowie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I write a thing or two once in a while, and hopefully some day I will actually get to those three articles!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wait, you&#039;re telling me that already happened? Huh, time flies by quickly. Anyways, welcome to my authorpage then!&lt;/p&gt;
