&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The second installment in my short &#039;series&#039; centered around the world of the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/revised-entry&quot;&gt;Revised Entry&lt;/a&gt; of SCP-173. Though looking back, it&#039;s pretty mediocre, I still like it quite the bit - especially considering that this was the first article my author avatar, Daniel Asheworth, appeared in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
