/span>. Yes, I know that technically I don't count for the &quot;International Skip Of Mystery&quot; mystery achievement, but English isn't my main language so that sorta counts. For the explanation about the &quot;Certificate Of Attendance&quot;, which requires for me to add to a Collaborative Log, I was the one who created the two reimaginings of two of the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/roget-s-proposal">Roget</a> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/roget-s-conspiracy-theory-for-scp-001">Proposals</a> in the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/abridged-retirement-proposals">Abridged Retirement Proposals</a> during its drafting phase, so that also technically counts.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <blockquote> <p>&quot;im gonna separate you from your family&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1802367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="stephlynch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1802367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" >stephlynch</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;𝔩𝐎ØⓀ 𝓲ή Δ м𝕚𝐑Ｒ𝓸г&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span> upon being asked to insult me, apparently summing<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-771301-7" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >7</a></sup> Cthulhu</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;Hey you little piss baby, you think you're so fucking cool, huh? You think you're so fucking tough? You talk a lot of ~big game~ for someone with such a ~small truck~&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2951719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="Tyumen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2951719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen" >Tyumen</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;do you actually write anything, ralliston&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;What the fuck did you just fucking say about me, you little bitch? I’ll have you know I graduated top of my class in the Navy Seals, and I’ve been involved in numerous secret raids on Al-Quaeda, and I have over 300 confirmed kills.<br /> I am trained in gorilla warfare and I’m the top sniper in the entire US armed forces. You are nothing to me but just another target. I will wipe you the fuck out with precision the likes of which has never been seen before on this Earth, mark my fucking words.<br /> You think you can get away with saying that shit to me over the Internet? Think again, fucker. As we speak I am contacting my secret network of spies across the USA and your IP is being traced right now so you better prepare for the storm, maggot. The storm that wipes out the pathetic little thing you call your life. You’re fucking dead, Ralliston. I can be anywhere, anytime, and I can kill you in over seven hundred ways, and that’s just with my bare hands.<br /> Not only am I extensively trained in unarmed combat, but I have access to the entire arsenal of the United States Marine Corps and I will use it to its full extent to wipe your miserable ass off the face of the continent, you little shit. If only you could have known what unholy retribution your little “clever” critique was about to bring down upon you, maybe you would have held your fucking tongue.<br /> But you couldn’t, you didn’t, and now you’re paying the price, you goddamn idiot. I will shit fury all over you and you will drown in it.<br /> You’re fucking dead, Ralliston.&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trymeline" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6501232&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="Trymeline" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6501232)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trymeline" >Trymeline</a></span>, most likely drunkenly</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;can i be your son ralliston&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" >chiifu</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;Who?&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6760712&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="WizzBlizz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6760712)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" >WizzBlizz</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853688" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-771301-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Though some may know me by my Discord nickname, Kein - both are fine.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-771301-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. For some pictures of said girls, please see the 'Cool Stuff!' part of the page.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-771301-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. For an explanation as to what this is, see the 'Cool Stuff!' part of the page.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-771301-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. And will most likely by the dumbest I ever will.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-771301-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. Which failed miserably.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-771301-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. I should mention here that the best way to content me is through Discord, I go there by Kein#5142.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-771301-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. Yes, you’ve heard me right - summing.</div> </div> 
