irm my identity if needed, and various users have enough of my personal information that they can further confirm my legitimacy.</p> <p><strong>Emergency Contacts:</strong> If I am desperately needed and cannot be reached over IRC or Wikidot, a bunch of folks have my Discord information, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5950867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853689" alt="KaraKatt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5950867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" >KaraKatt</a></span> has my phone number; they can reach out to me for you.</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-7" style="display:none"> <p>This tab is just for anything else that I need to keep track of or whatever.</p> <hr /> <p>Keeping an eye on these:</p> <hr /> <p>My to-do list:</p> <ul> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Write recommended authors/articles list.</span></li> <li>Add more author commentaries.</li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">FINISH THE 507 LOG YOU IDIOT.</span> YES!</li> <li>Ask the Rewrite team if you can do something with the old Decommissioned SCPs.</li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Fix the redactions on 194.</span></li> </ul> <hr /> <p><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/calibri-bold-s-seminars-sandbox">Seminars Sandbox</a></p> <p><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/calibri-bold-s-mast-sandbox">MAST Sandbox</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606853689" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-685431-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Not a tale or anything, mind you.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-685431-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. Long story. Actually, not really. I thought of it and it was weird.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-685431-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. Or sub-department, depending on your headcanon.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-685431-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. I'm not gonna spoil it, you have to read it yourself.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-685431-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. While I was around for the SCP-5000 Contest, real life issues at the time meant I was unable to participate.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-685431-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. I'm not counting this author page because a) it's ever-growing, and b) it's technically two author pages smushed together.</div> </div> 
